13:p0889:b003:l012","ordinal":144170,"en":"When the forty companions attacked,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0889:b003:l014","ordinal":144171,"en":"Stood without drawing back,","gapBefore":"[Source wording unresolved; translation pending]"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0889:b003:l015","ordinal":144172,"en":"And fought the forty companions."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0889:b003:l016","ordinal":144173,"en":"Not forty companions, but forty baldheads—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0889:b003:l017","ordinal":144174,"en":"Fools with crooked minds,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0889:b003:l018","ordinal":144175,"en":"Forty outstanding men come from forty places."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0889:b003:l020","ordinal":144176,"en":"All were heroes skilled among spearmen,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0889:b003:l021","ordinal":144177,"en":"All were mighty heroes who knew the arts of jousting."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0889:b003:l023","ordinal":144178,"en":"They all leveled their spears,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0889:b003:l024","ordinal":144179,"en":"Spurred their horses and fought."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0889:b003:l025","ordinal":144180,"en":"The forty fierce warriors surrounded him"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0889:b003:l026","ordinal":144181,"en":"And now reached Sary Khan;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0889:b003:l027","ordinal":144182,"en":"All forty struck him, one and all."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0889:b003:l028","ordinal":144183,"en":"As though Judgment Day had come,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0889:b003:l029","ordinal":144184,"en":"His entire body"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0889:b003:l030","ordinal":144185,"en":"Grew numb, unable to stir."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0889:b003:l031","ordinal":144186,"en":"His two hands that gave him strength"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0889:b003:l032","ordinal":144187,"en":"Hung paralyzed, unable to rise."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0889:b003:l033","ordinal":144188,"en":"His poor head, like a great cauldron,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0889:b003:l035","ordinal":144189,"en":"Sary Khan was in dire distress.","gapBefore":"[Source wording unresolved; translation pending]"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0889:b003:l036","ordinal":144190,"en":"Since Sary Khan had come into being,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0889:b003:l037","ordinal":144191,"en":"Since he had won the name Sary Khan,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0889:b003:l038","ordinal":144192,"en":"Since he had first sat astride a horse,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0889:b003:l039","ordinal":144193,"en":"His appointed death had not yet come;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0889:b005:l001","ordinal":144194,"en":"Fierce warriors like the forty companions"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0889:b005:l002","ordinal":144195,"en":"He had never seen upon the earth."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0889:b005:l003","ordinal":144196,"en":"At Ken-Kol there is the Ak-Chiy plain."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0889:b005:l004","ordinal":144197,"en":"Fighting upon that plain,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0889:b005:l005","ordinal":144198,"en":"In Sary Khan's flesh"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0889:b005:l006","ordinal":144199,"en":"Were wounds in sixty places."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0889:b005:l007","ordinal":144200,"en":"Upon Sary Khan's head"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0889:b005:l008","ordinal":144201,"en":"They were heaping torment."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0889:b005:l009","ordinal":144202,"en":"The reason they tormented him so—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0889:b005:l010","ordinal":144203,"en":"While Lion Manas was alive,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0889:b005:l011","ordinal":144204,"en":"There was no hero they had not faced,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0889:b005:l012","ordinal":144205,"en":"No place they had not challenged."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0889:b005:l013","ordinal":144206,"en":"Clashing with the unbelievers,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0889:b005:l014","ordinal":144207,"en":"With the teeming Manchu multitude,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0889:b005:l015","ordinal":144208,"en":"Fighting with the Chinese,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0889:b005:l016","ordinal":144209,"en":"The forty companions had grown seasoned."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0889:b005:l017","ordinal":144210,"en":"They now surrounded him,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0889:b005:l018","ordinal":144211,"en":"And upon your uncle Sary Khan"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0889:b005:l019","ordinal":144212,"en":"Laid terrible hardship."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0889:b005:l020","ordinal":144213,"en":"As they were about to seize Khan Sary"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0889:b005:l021","ordinal":144214,"en":"And offer him as a sacrifice,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0889:b005:l022","ordinal":144215,"en":"Your valiant sister-in-law Kanykei"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0889:b005:l023","ordinal":144216,"en":"Came out to face them and attacked."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0889:b005:l024","ordinal":144217,"en":"Leaning down, she speared the warriors."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0889:b005:l025","ordinal":144218,"en":"With every thrust Kanykei"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0889:b005:l026","ordinal":144219,"en":"Speared four or five at once."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0889:b005:l027","ordinal":144220,"en":"Can a woman be like this?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0889:b005:l028","ordinal":144221,"en":"Can one rightly call her merely a woman?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0889:b005:l029","ordinal":144222,"en":"For all the forty companions"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0889:b005:l030","ordinal":144223,"en":"Your sister-in-law found the remedy."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0889:b005:l031","ordinal":144224,"en":"Shattering them to powder,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0889:b005:l032","ordinal":144225,"en":"She speared them all, every one."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0889:b005:l033","ordinal":144226,"en":"The forty companions who had shown such courage,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0889:b005:l034","ordinal":144227,"en":"Their wings broken,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0889:b005:l035","ordinal":144228,"en":"Deprived of their horses,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0889:b005:l036","ordinal":144229,"en":"Sat down in a miserable huddle."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0889:b005:l037","ordinal":144230,"en":"“O sister-in-law, we submit!” they cried,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0889:b005:l038","ordinal":144231,"en":"Crouching like howling dogs."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0889:b005:l039","ordinal":144232,"en":"Your lionlike mother Kanykei"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0890:b003:l001","ordinal":144233,"en":"She and Sary Khan joined together,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0890:b003:l002","ordinal":144234,"en":"Drove off their horses,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0890:b003:l003","ordinal":144235,"en":"And brought them toward the hills."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0890:b003:l004","ordinal":144236,"en":"The forty swift horses of the forty companions"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0890:b003:l005","ordinal":144237,"en":"They took as spoils."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0890:b003:l006","ordinal":144238,"en":"Abyke and Kobosh, all six—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0890:b003:l007","ordinal":144239,"en":"The great army surging forward,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0890:b003:l008","ordinal":144240,"en":"Taking swords and springing to attack,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0890:b003:l009","ordinal":144241,"en":"Fell upon Semetey."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0890:b003:l010","ordinal":144242,"en":"When they were about to seize him,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0890:b003:l011","ordinal":144243,"en":"About to slaughter him as a sacrifice,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0890:b003:l012","ordinal":144244,"en":"Manas’s son, that warrior—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0890:b003:l013","ordinal":144245,"en":"His twelve bodily parts made perfect,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0890:b003:l014","ordinal":144246,"en":"The orphan son of Manas,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0890:b003:l015","ordinal":144247,"en":"Almighty Allah"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0890:b003:l016","ordinal":144248,"en":"Had made a lion among humankind."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0890:b003:l017","ordinal":144249,"en":"“Abyke and Kobosh—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0890:b003:l018","ordinal":144250,"en":"Let me seize them alive,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0890:b003:l019","ordinal":144251,"en":"Settle them in broad Talas,"},