p0890:b004:l002","ordinal":144273,"en":"Inside the white saddlebags,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0890:b004:l003","ordinal":144274,"en":"Were six cheyrek of ammunition."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0890:b004:l004","ordinal":144275,"en":"He had wrought great havoc;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0890:b004:l005","ordinal":144276,"en":"Those saddlebags’"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0890:b004:l006","ordinal":144277,"en":"Mouth he opened."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0890:b004:l007","ordinal":144278,"en":"Taking Akkelte in hand,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0890:b004:l008","ordinal":144279,"en":"Leaning right, he fired once;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0890:b004:l009","ordinal":144280,"en":"Leaning left, he fired once,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0890:b004:l010","ordinal":144281,"en":"Sending dust swirling on the left."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0890:b004:l011","ordinal":144282,"en":"Whenever Akkelte struck,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0890:b004:l012","ordinal":144283,"en":"It shattered the crest of the steep bank."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0890:b004:l013","ordinal":144284,"en":"When Akkelte cracked,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0890:b004:l014","ordinal":144285,"en":"Its thunder deafened the ears;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0890:b004:l015","ordinal":144286,"en":"Its shot whistled with a ringing cry."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0890:b004:l016","ordinal":144287,"en":"When it drew near the enemy,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0890:b004:l017","ordinal":144288,"en":"It bellowed like a camel with her calf."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0890:b004:l018","ordinal":144289,"en":"When it came still nearer,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0890:b004:l019","ordinal":144290,"en":"It trailed like a star;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0890:b004:l020","ordinal":144291,"en":"Its scattered shot screamed."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0890:b004:l021","ordinal":144292,"en":"When they saw the commotion of the shots,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0890:b004:l022","ordinal":144293,"en":"Abyke and Kobosh, those six scoundrels,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0890:b004:l023","ordinal":144294,"en":"Split apart and fled in haste."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0890:b004:l024","ordinal":144295,"en":"He fired not once, but a thousand times;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0890:b004:l025","ordinal":144296,"en":"A thousand times his shots reached them."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0890:b004:l026","ordinal":144297,"en":"“I shall frighten them,” he thought;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0890:b004:l027","ordinal":144298,"en":"The young sultan, that warrior,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0890:b004:l028","ordinal":144299,"en":"Was shooting far away."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0890:b004:l030","ordinal":144300,"en":"It tore off Kobosh’s head.","gapBefore":"[Source wording unresolved; translation pending]"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0890:b004:l031","ordinal":144301,"en":"From Köktelki’s back,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0890:b004:l032","ordinal":144302,"en":"Your uncle Kobosh fell."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0890:b004:l033","ordinal":144303,"en":"He sent Kobosh to the grave;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0890:b004:l034","ordinal":144304,"en":"He showed his fierce nature."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0890:b004:l035","ordinal":144305,"en":"He killed his own elder kinsman;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0890:b004:l036","ordinal":144306,"en":"He poured blood into the dark water."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0890:b004:l037","ordinal":144307,"en":"He set the grassy land ablaze;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0890:b004:l038","ordinal":144308,"en":"He drank blood and grew hardened,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0890:b004:l039","ordinal":144309,"en":"Drinking Kobosh’s blood,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0891:b003:l001","ordinal":144310,"en":"He gained the name of blood-drinking slayer."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0891:b003:l002","ordinal":144311,"en":"He soaked the broad valley in fat;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0891:b003:l003","ordinal":144312,"en":"As soon as this slayer arrived,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0891:b003:l004","ordinal":144313,"en":"He killed Khan Kobosh."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0891:b003:l005","ordinal":144314,"en":"When his uncle Kobosh died,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0891:b003:l006","ordinal":144315,"en":"His heart was troubled."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0891:b003:l007","ordinal":144316,"en":"Among those left alive,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0891:b003:l008","ordinal":144317,"en":"Abyke came into view."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0891:b003:l009","ordinal":144318,"en":"Then Semetey,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0891:b003:l010","ordinal":144319,"en":"Taking his painted spear in hand,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0891:b003:l011","ordinal":144320,"en":"Made Buurul plunge and strain,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0891:b003:l012","ordinal":144321,"en":"Made him lunge like a widow in grief."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0891:b003:l013","ordinal":144322,"en":"The sight troubled the heart;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0891:b003:l014","ordinal":144323,"en":"He appeared like Mount Opol."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0891:b003:l015","ordinal":144324,"en":"Girded with a golden belt,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0891:b003:l016","ordinal":144325,"en":"His moon-like face shone with light;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0891:b003:l017","ordinal":144326,"en":"His fearful majesty loomed grimly."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0891:b003:l018","ordinal":144327,"en":"That fierce hero of surpassing fortune—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0891:b003:l019","ordinal":144328,"en":"Which of his deeds shall we tell?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0891:b003:l020","ordinal":144329,"en":"Girded with a silver belt,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0891:b003:l021","ordinal":144330,"en":"His sun-like face shone with light;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0891:b003:l022","ordinal":144331,"en":"Muttering, looming grimly,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0891:b003:l023","ordinal":144332,"en":"Your sultan of surpassing fortune"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0891:b003:l024","ordinal":144333,"en":"Had many troubles fall upon his head."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0891:b003:l025","ordinal":144334,"en":"His heart was troubled;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0891:b003:l026","ordinal":144335,"en":"His elders, Abyke and Kobosh—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0891:b003:l027","ordinal":144336,"en":"Their treachery came before his eyes."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0891:b003:l028","ordinal":144337,"en":"Bracing and readying himself,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0891:b003:l029","ordinal":144338,"en":"Great grief fell upon him."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0891:b003:l030","ordinal":144339,"en":"Your hero, your lord, then"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0891:b003:l031","ordinal":144340,"en":"Swayed as though struck by a peri."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0891:b003:l032","ordinal":144341,"en":"His ribs seemed to come apart;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0891:b003:l033","ordinal":144342,"en":"Semetey grieved,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0891:b003:l034","ordinal":144343,"en":"His heart troubled,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0891:b003:l035","ordinal":144344,"en":"A great burden falling upon his head."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0891:b003:l036","ordinal":144345,"en":"“My own kinsmen fire upon me;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0891:b003:l037","ordinal":144346,"en":"Such is this grievous trouble!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0891:b003:l038","ordinal":144347,"en":"I mounted Buurul, calling him my swift steed;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0891:b003:l039","ordinal":144348,"en":"I returned, wretched soul that I am,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0891:b005:l001","ordinal":144349,"en":"Calling Abyke and Kobosh my kin."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0891:b005:l002","ordinal":144350,"en":"My kinsmen became my enemies;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0891:b005:l003","ordinal":144351,"en":"My foe arose from within my own."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0891:b005:l004","ordinal":144352,"en":"Raise a young camel, and it becomes a camel."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0891:b005:l005","ordinal":144353,"en":"Almighty Allah,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0891:b005:l006","ordinal":144354,"en":"A person all alone—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0891:b005:l007","ordinal":144355,"en":"Why not refrain from creating one?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0891:b005:l008","ordinal":144356,"en":"I have no mane or tail at all;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0891:b005:l009","ordinal":144357,"en":"I am like a wild ass."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0891:b005:l010","ordinal":144358,"en":"I have no foot to swing forward;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0891:b005:l011","ordinal":144359,"en":"I am like a snake!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0891:b005:l012","ordinal":144360,"en":"I have no swift steed but Buurul."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0891:b005:l013","ordinal":144361,"en":"World that makes me grieve, may you never prosper!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0891:b005:l014","ordinal":144362,"en":"Nor have I a kinsman to resolve my grief."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0891:b005:l016","ordinal":144363,"en":"When I go to the front, there is no supporting figure;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0891:b005:l017","ordinal":144364,"en":"If I lead against the Kara-Khitai,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0891:b005:l018","ordinal":144365,"en":"To follow like a shadow,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0891:b005:l019","ordinal":144366,"en":"There is no supporting figure behind me."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0891:b005:l020","ordinal":144367,"en":"The pine is alone; I am alone."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0891:b005:l021","ordinal":144368,"en":"My khan father Manas, do not die!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0891:b005:l022","ordinal":144369,"en":"Black night falls upon my head;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0891:b005:l023","ordinal":144370,"en":"Wretched soul, may you never know grief!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0891:b005:l024","ordinal":144371,"en":"May the good of this world never die;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0891:b005:l025","ordinal":144372,"en":"May the bad not remain behind!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0891:b005:l026","ordinal":144373,"en":"Whose every step becomes a deep hollow—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0891:b005:l027","ordinal":144374,"en":"Is there anyone as sorrowful as I?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0891:b005:l028","ordinal":144375,"en":"Whose own kinsmen become enemies—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0891:b005:l029","ordinal":144376,"en":"Is there anyone as ill-fated as I?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0891:b005:l030","ordinal":144377,"en":"Ordinary iron will not become steel,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0891:b005:l031","ordinal":144378,"en":"Wretched world, what can I do?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0891:b005:l032","ordinal":144379,"en":"Dogs raised apart will not become my people!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0891:b005:l033","ordinal":144380,"en":"Pieced-together iron does not become steel;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0891:b005:l034","ordinal":144381,"en":"Ruined world, what can I do?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0891:b005:l035","ordinal":144382,"en":"Mad dogs will not become my people!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0891:b005:l036","ordinal":144383,"en":"From the ledge upon the cliffside,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0891:b005:l037","ordinal":144384,"en":"My Creator and Lord, what can I do?"}]
